ever a consensus verdict**.\n- New **`decisions` table** (CC1 disposition declared + dry-run tested) records accept/decline/snooze and **doubles as the label source** feeding Wave 2's deferred weight-validation.\n- **No Helping-Hand auto-plumbing in this run** â€” once accepted-decisions reach **nâ‰¥30**, a future run wires accepts into Helping Hand and validates.\n\n**North-Star inclusion mapping (claimed)**\n- W1 â†’ NS1, NS2; W2 â†’ NS1, NS4; W3 â†’ NS1, NS2, NS3(fit); W4 â†’ NS1, NS5; W5 â†’ NS3 (+labelsâ†’NS4); W6 â†’ only weak NS1 (basis for deferral).\n\n**Stage 1 approval gate â€” decisions put to the user**\n1. Approve the resequenced 5-wave plan (yes / edit).\n2. The map (W6): Shark Tank recommends **defer**; user had locked it \"IN-but-optional\" at Stage 0 (defer / keep).\n3. Adoption shrink: confirm **no Helping-Hand auto-adoption now**, capture labels + log decisions until nâ‰¥30, revisit later (yes / want more now).\n4. Any wave-order reweighting.\n\n**Member documents**\n- *Crucible Stage 1 â€” Master Plan: Aurora Awareness Revamp*\n- *Aurora Awareness Revamp â€” Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready)*\n\n---\n\nOne note on grounding: the recent git log (commits for **W2â€“W5**, including \"correct the W3 migration 'breakage' (was a WAL-copy false alarm)\") indicates this plan has since been **built**, so these bullets describe the *plan as approved at Stage 1*, not the final as-shipped state. Want me to reconcile the plan against what actually landed in the commits?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4317,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8796,"cache_read_input_tokens":20861,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8796},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6dc0600e-7e7b-4e8a-aa0e-a1d471ec0272","uuid":"43211511-7393-4341-b6d9-cacf24a890dc","reques